# The Gut's cave life.

ent-WFMobCavernBileSlug = bile slug
    .desc = A fat yellow slug that grazes the bile. The acid doesn't trouble it, and it wants nothing to do with you.

ent-WFMobCavernAntibody = antibody
    .desc = A white blood cell grown to the size of a man. It engulfs whatever doesn't belong in the Gut.

ent-WFMobCavernBloodLeech = blood leech
    .desc = A leech that swims the blood channels. It bites whoever wades in and drinks.

ent-WFGastricMoss = gastric moss
    .desc = A tuft of yellow-green moss from the stomach wall. Eat it for a little healing, or cut it up to bind on a wound.

ent-WFMarrowCap = marrow cap
    .desc = A cream-coloured cap that grew on bone dust. Cook two with water in a big bowl for mushroom soup.

ent-WFCavernGastricMossPlant = gastric moss
    .desc = Moss that thrives in the bile on the stomach wall. Pick it to eat or to dress a wound.

ent-WFCavernMarrowCapPlant = marrow cap
    .desc = A cream-coloured mushroom feeding on bone dust. Pick it and cook it.

ent-WFCavernNerveWhip = nerve whip
    .desc = A bundle of raw nerve, pink and twitching. Touch it and it fires: a shock, and a fall.

ent-WFCavernAcidPolyp = acid polyp
    .desc = A bile-yellow polyp on the stomach wall. It spits digestive acid at anything that comes within sight.

wf-cavern-nerve-whip-lashes = The nerves whip across you and the world jolts!
